    UiText:
      outlineWidth: 2
      text: 'Push every crate onto a goal (the red marks); a crate turns gold on its goal. Crates are pushed one at a time, never pulled: a crate stuck in a corner stays there, so undo is never far. The fewest moves of a level are kept.'
